  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: We provide borehole drilling services in South Africa, and all borehole drilling clients are attended to on time. <br>• What makes us different: We provide both digital and manual surveys before we drill our boreholes, so we drill boreholes that will sustain our clients with enough water for a lifetime with no problems or complaints.<br>• How affiliates can earn: Your duty is to promote our business in South Africa and have them book their borehole drilling  service by paying for the service through our website. The truck will be at their house within 2-5 business days. Please note that our borehole full package drilling and installation includes a submersible pump, 100-meter pipe, control box, and 3 meters of steel casing. Any additional steel casing is charged at R800.00 per meter. If a client would like to book us for a survey before they can make their booking, they can also pay for a survey, ranging from a digital survey (R3,500.00), a manual survey (R6,500.00), and a geological survey (R7,500.00).<br>• How to promote us: We are offering a R5,000.00 discount and a free 2400 liters water storage tank to all our clients who book their boreholes through our website and through your link, get this offer.<br>• Locations we cover: We have drilling trucks in every province, so yes, we can assist anyone and everyone as long as they are in South Africa.</p></div></div>",
